## Contributing

This started as a personal project for skiing in Tignes / Val d'Isère
and grew into something more general. Issues and PRs welcome. If you've
used skiroute on a non-Alpine resort and the defaults didn't work well,
that's especially interesting — please open an issue with what you saw.
